  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 3.0.0: Added streaming request support via IStreamRequest/IStreamRequestHandler with IAsyncEnumerable for scenarios like AI chat streaming. New CreateStream method on IMediator. Auto-discovery of stream handlers. High-performance mediator with compiled expressions, background notifications, pipeline behaviors, file-based persistence with retry logic, and built-in ConfigureAwait(false). Supports .NET 8, 9, and 10.",
